{"title": "Adjusted Ranged Equipment Trader Table", "pageid": 24961, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Adjusted_Ranged_Equipment_Trader_Table", "categories": ["Vendor tables", "Drop tables"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Adjusted Ranged Equipment Trader Table</b>, also known as <code>EquipmentTrader_Ranged_Adjusted</code>&nbsp;<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:EquipmentTrader_Ranged_Adjusted+type:treasuretable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:EquipmentTrader_Ranged_Adjusted+type:treasuretable\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>, is a leveled <a href=\"/wiki/Treasure_Table\" title=\"Treasure Table\">Treasure Table</a> that is a variant of the <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Ranged_Equipment_Trader_Table&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Ranged Equipment Trader Table (page does not exist)\">Ranged Equipment Trader Table</a> that produces fewer items. It contains special <a href=\"/wiki/Arrows\" title=\"Arrows\">arrows</a> and mundane and magical <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Ranged_weapons\" title=\"Category:Ranged weapons\">ranged weapons</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drop_table\">Drop table</span></h2>\n<i>The following section can be transcluded into other pages with <code>{{:Adjusted Ranged Equipment Trader Table}}</code>.</i><table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th colspan=\"2\">Item</th>\n  <th>Quantity</th>\n  <th>Chance</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special_Arrow_Subtable\" title=\"Special Arrow Subtable\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Arrow_of_Ilmater_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Arrow_of_Ilmater_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2d/Arrow_of_Ilmater_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Arrow_of_Ilmater_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/2d/Arrow_of_Ilmater_Unfaded_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Arrow_of_Ilmater_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Arrow_of_Ilmater_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Arrow_of_Ilmater_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Special_Arrow_Subtable\" title=\"Special Arrow Subtable\">Special Arrow Subtable</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">12</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">always</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Simple_Ranged_Weapon_Subtable\" title=\"Simple Ranged Weapon Subtable\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Simple_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/40px-Simple_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Simple_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/60px-Simple_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/de/Simple_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Simple_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/40px-Simple_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/de/Simple_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Simple_Ranged_Weapon_Subtable\" title=\"Simple Ranged Weapon Subtable\">Simple Ranged Weapon Subtable</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">always</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Ranged_Weapon_Subtable\" title=\"Martial Ranged Weapon Subtable\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/40px-Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/60px-Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/40px-Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Ranged_Weapon_Subtable\" title=\"Martial Ranged Weapon Subtable\">Martial Ranged Weapon Subtable</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">always</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Ranged_Weapon_Trader_Table\" title=\"Magic Ranged Weapon Trader Table\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/40px-Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/60px-Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png 2x\"><img